{"3318080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grorb: Grow the Orb", "steam_appid": 3318080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grorb: Grow the Orb</strong> is a minimalist incremental game where a single orb holds infinite potential. Harvest energy, accumulate resources, and unlock powerful upgrades to push your orb—and your capabilities—beyond imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/c91459c04636c9fa3e71b4ef5223df3d.poster.avif?t=1752253436\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/c91459c04636c9fa3e71b4ef5223df3d.webm?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/c91459c04636c9fa3e71b4ef5223df3d.mp4?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steady Evolution</strong><br>Watch your orb transform through progressive stages of growth as you invest resources. Each milestone brings fresh upgrade paths, revealing new strategies and deeper layers of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/2fcbc50453c4e3b2c36e3b25a8e97ac1.poster.avif?t=1752253436\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/2fcbc50453c4e3b2c36e3b25a8e97ac1.webm?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/2fcbc50453c4e3b2c36e3b25a8e97ac1.mp4?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Optimize</strong><br>From speed boosts to advanced resource converters, tailor your orb’s development to suit your playstyle. Plan your upgrades carefully to maintain momentum, ensuring no resource goes to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Resource Management</strong><br>Balance immediate power gains against long-term benefits. Discover synergy effects among your upgrades, and time your acquisitions to surge ahead when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Aesthetic</strong>: Crisp visuals and a streamlined interface let you focus purely on growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Progression</strong>: Each breakthrough feels satisfying, revealing new upgrade tiers and strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Dynamics</strong>: Manage energy, currency, and special bonuses to keep your orb flourishing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your orb from a humble sphere to a mighty force of nature. In <strong>Grorb: Grow the Orb</strong>, your dedication and strategic thinking shape the path to limitless expansion.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grorb: Grow the Orb</strong> is a minimalist incremental game where a single orb holds infinite potential. Harvest energy, accumulate resources, and unlock powerful upgrades to push your orb—and your capabilities—beyond imagination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/c91459c04636c9fa3e71b4ef5223df3d.poster.avif?t=1752253436\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/c91459c04636c9fa3e71b4ef5223df3d.webm?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/c91459c04636c9fa3e71b4ef5223df3d.mp4?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steady Evolution</strong><br>Watch your orb transform through progressive stages of growth as you invest resources. Each milestone brings fresh upgrade paths, revealing new strategies and deeper layers of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/2fcbc50453c4e3b2c36e3b25a8e97ac1.poster.avif?t=1752253436\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/2fcbc50453c4e3b2c36e3b25a8e97ac1.webm?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318080/extras/2fcbc50453c4e3b2c36e3b25a8e97ac1.mp4?t=1752253436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Optimize</strong><br>From speed boosts to advanced resource converters, tailor your orb’s development to suit your playstyle. Plan your upgrades carefully to maintain momentum, ensuring no resource goes to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Resource Management</strong><br>Balance immediate power gains against long-term benefits. Discover synergy effects among your upgrades, and time your acquisitions to surge ahead when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Aesthetic</strong>: Crisp visuals and a streamlined interface let you focus purely on growt